cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fourier or its scheduling analysis, please cite the technical report below. Link to the GitHub code artifact and identify the software version or commit used; no separate software citation is needed."
type: software
title: "Fourier: Spectrum Analysis and Spectrogram Visualization for VCV Rack"
abstract: >-
  Fourier is an Arhythmetic Units plugin for VCV Rack containing the Fourier
  spectrum analyzer and Spectre spectrogram visualizer. It provides incremental
  Fourier transforms, window functions, time and frequency smoothing, and
  reusable C++ digital signal processing components.
authors:
  - family-names: Kauten
    given-names: Christian
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kautenja/ArhythmeticUnits-Fourier"
version: "2.1.2"
date-released: "2025-04-14"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - digital signal processing
  - spectrum analysis
  - spectrogram
  - fast Fourier transform
  - short-time Fourier transform
  - modular synthesis
  - VCV Rack
  - C++
